{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-viessmann-vitorondens-200-t-slash-222-f-oil-condensing-boiler-with-vitoflame-300-oil-blue-flame-burner-2601-0285","content_id":"9796a997-d532-4d67-8ef6-8bbf22c05be4","description":"Product Recall for Viessmann Vitorondens 200-T / 222-F Oil Condensing Boiler with Vitoflame 300 Oil Blue Flame Burner presenting a risk of asphyxiation. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"2e010cfc-4779-4c7c-a7fb-0725393b1526","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-03-10T16:19:00+00:00","id":"2e010cfc-4779-4c7c-a7fb-0725393b1526","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-03-10T16:19:00+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69b0447458d4ef5adaf0e40d/2601-0285-product-recall-vitorondens200T-222F.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Viessmann Vitorondens 200-T / 222-F Oil Condensing Boiler with Vitoflame 300 Oil Blue Flame Burner</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a high risk of asphyxiation as testing has indicated that some 2021-2023 boilers may ignite late, causing pressure damage and possible CO leaks.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action:  Veissmann have notified end users who are affected by this issue and have warned installers of the risks.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Gas appliances and components – Oil Condensing Boiler</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Veissmann </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Models</td>\n      <td>Vitorondens 200-T / 222-F; Vitoladens 300-T (33 kW)</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>Germany</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>The Vitorondens 200T/222F is a residential oil condensing boiler with a Vitoflame 300 blue‑flame burner, cast‑iron primary and stainless‑steel secondary heat exchanger. It is managed by an LMO burner control and Vitotronic system.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_2e010cfc-4779-4c7c-a7fb-0725393b1526\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69b0447458d4ef5adaf0e40d/2601-0285-product-recall-vitorondens200T-222F.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a high risk of asphyxiation as testing has indicated that some 2021-2023 boilers may ignite late, causing pressure damage and possible CO leaks. This could expose people in the building to unsafe exhaust gases and potentially lead to asphyxiation.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>Veissmann have notified end users who are affected by this issue and have warned installers of the risks.  </p>\n\n<p>Affected users will receive a replacement ignition module and burner control unit, and a CO detector with shut-off function or conversion of the burner to current series configuration with pressure sensor.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2601-0285</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-03-10T16:19:33Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"gas-appliances-and-components","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users","other"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-03-10","product_risk_level":"high"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-03-10T16:19:33+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-viessmann-vitorondens-200-t-slash-222-f-oil-condensing-boiler-with-vitoflame-300-oil-blue-flame-burner-2601-0285","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-viessmann-vitorondens-200-t-slash-222-f-oil-condensing-boiler-with-vitoflame-300-oil-blue-flame-burner-2601-0285","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-viessmann-vitorondens-200-t-slash-222-f-oil-condensing-boiler-with-vitoflame-300-oil-blue-flame-burner-2601-0285","content_id":"9796a997-d532-4d67-8ef6-8bbf22c05be4","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-03-10T16:19:33Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Recall: Viessmann Vitorondens 200-T / 222-F Oil Condensing Boiler with Vitoflame 300 Oil Blue Flame Burner  (2601-0285)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-viessmann-vitorondens-200-t-slash-222-f-oil-condensing-boiler-with-vitoflame-300-oil-blue-flame-burner-2601-0285","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","content_id":"a22b3f1f-2c91-49a1-a469-ff21d465c543","details":{"facets":[{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Product safety alert","value":"product-safety-alert"},{"label":"Product safety report","value":"product-safety-report"},{"label":"Product recall","value":"product-recall"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filterable":true,"key":"product_alert_type","name":"Alert type","preposition":"of type","short_name":"Alert type"